identified as such.

Submission, demonstration, review, grading, defense, storage, transfer, or
possession of a copy of SlotBridge does not transfer, assign, waive, or abandon
authorship, copyright, exclusive rights, or other rights belonging to the
author.

2. Academic evaluation permission

Educational institutions, teachers, examiners, supervisors, and other
authorized academic personnel may access, run, display, and review SlotBridge
solely for the purpose of evaluating the author's academic work.

This permission is limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, and does not grant
ownership or any broader right to exploit, publish, redistribute, modify for
redistribution, or commercialize the Project.

